# calc — living spec

REQ-calc-001 (event-driven): WHEN two operands are added, the system SHALL
return their arithmetic sum.
verify: test:TestAddCarries

REQ-calc-002 (event-driven): WHEN one operand is subtracted from another, the
system SHALL return their arithmetic difference.
verify: test:TestSubBorrows
